## Validation matrix

{{VALIDATION_MATRIX}}

Start with the smallest relevant check, then run the affected target/suite and required build. Use temporary output/cache directories when supported; do not pollute the repository.

## Diff checks

```bash
git diff --check
git diff --stat
git diff
git status --short
```

Compare against the starting status. Check for secrets, personal data, generated output, editor state, binaries, fixtures, lockfiles, and unrelated formatting according to project policy.

## Result record

Report each command, scope, pass/fail/not-run, decisive error, manual checks, and residual risk. Required failures mean the task is incomplete or blocked.
